"王随","text":"照池莲艳红疑菜，入户山光翠可枯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19110,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十一","author":"王随","text":"岸草雪残迎马绿，野梅风暖著人香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19111,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三十六","author":"王随","text":"住僧忘岁月，游客悟尘劳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19112,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十二","author":"王随","text":"村重晚笛吹遥岭，渔舍寒罾晒夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19113,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十六","author":"王随","text":"雨霁烟波帆挂晓，月明楼阁笛横秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19114,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明福观","author":"王傅","text":"泉源山下延平旷，路入松关起清爽。\n飞云西峙积翠台，突兀三千六百丈。\n杏花片片铺金坛，天风吹桂香漫山。\n游人尽去萝月上，觉我身世非人间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19115,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登更好堂同景思少卿表丈韵","author":"王嵎","text":"万里同行一瘦筇，寻山问水有先容。\n更穷天姥投南路，已过台山第几峰。\n从此又随双涧月，不妨曾听五峰钟。\n却从更好堂前望，满眼诗材思不供。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19116,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜行船","author":"王嵎","text":"曲水溅裙三月二。\n马如龙、钿车如水。\n风扬游丝，日烘晴昼，人共海棠俱醉。\n客里光阴难可意。\n扫芳尘、旧游谁记。\n午梦醒来，小窗人静，春在卖花声里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19117,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祝英台近","author":"王嵎","text":"柳烟浓，花露重，合是醉时候。\n楼倚花梢，长记小垂手。\n谁教钗燕轻分，镜鸾慵舞，是孤负、几番春昼。\n自别后。\n闻道花底花前，多是两眉皱。\n又说新来，比似旧时瘦。\n须知两意长存，相逢终有。\n莫谩被、春光僝僽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19118,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"王彭年","text":"人才七泽盛三湘。\n前辈敢追望。\n惭愧史君劝驾，杯前重赐篇章。\n雷风断送，鱼龙变化，云路蜚骧。\n德意如何报称，短歌莫写毫芒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":19119,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]